ARVIS rule-based FDD
====================

The fault-condition logic, thresholds, operational gates, confirmation
(latching) math and PID-hunting detector in this package are ported from
open-fdd (https://github.com/bbartling/open-fdd, PyPI "open-fdd" 4.4.7),
